id: pm-gh1735
title: "GH-1735: an inherited PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT=automation re-enables telemetry inside detected test runners, so package test fixtures emit as real automation activity"
description: "Inside a detected test runner (NODE_TEST_CONTEXT, VITEST, NODE_ENV=test, BUN_TEST), any recognized PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT re-enables telemetry. resolveTelemetryEnvironmentPolicy suppresses test telemetry only when the override is not a known source context. So an inherited automation value, which agent harnesses and release scripts export to attribute their real writes, makes every pm child a package test suite spawns emit full telemetry labelled automation. The context that labels who acts also decides whether to emit, and no setting keeps both."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
