author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "With NODE_TEST_CONTEXT set and PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT=automation inherited, telemetry stays suppressed (test_suppressed=true); With PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT=test or PM_TELEMETRY_SEND_TEST_EVENTS inside a test runner, telemetry emits labelled test; Outside a test runner, an automation source context behaves exactly as before; pm ops telemetry status reports the deciding input next to test_suppressed"
parent: pm-5oj5
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: resolveTelemetryEnvironmentPolicy suppresses test-runner telemetry unless PM_TELEMETRY_SOURCE_CONTEXT=test or PM_TELEMETRY_SEND_TEST_EVENTS opts in; such events are labelled test; env_overrides.decided_by reports the deciding input
expected_result: "With NODE_TEST_CONTEXT set and an inherited automation context, telemetry stays suppressed and status shows decided_by=env:NODE_TEST_CONTEXT"
actual_result: "Verified on the built CLI: enabled=false, test_suppressed=true, decided_by=env:NODE_TEST_CONTEXT; test opt-in enables; automation outside a runner is unchanged"
